      "writtenOn": "2024-03-15T14:42:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I verified manually that this conversion is similar to that done by ui/gfx/color_space through (Inverse(AdjustedRange)*Transfer) as it goes through [this](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:ui/gfx/color_transform.cc;drc\u003dc292340f0c721cd88f9b14c453c877c55d13ce6b;l\u003d1310) path. Although haven\u0027t confirmed with the other bit depths.",
      "revId": "53ff9aaad8e21de0d8605467e9fe7636037772dc",
